   562                              <1>     ; internal vars for accessing a net drive. All accesses still occur via the
   563                              <1>     ; redir, and the redir can update its vars as it needs. The DOS pointers
   564                              <1>     ; point as is necessary on the path (with machine name prefix), and in the SDA
   565                              <1>     ; so the redir can do it's job.
