   818                              <1> ;   Output: CF=NC: rdx -> Filename 
   819                              <1> ;           CF=CY: eax = Error code (errAccDen) if no filename ptr.
   820                              <1> ;                   The error case should only happen for special
   821                              <1> ;                   programs that are launched without an environment
   822                              <1> ;                   as DOS has nowhere to put the filename string.
